@@ -15,3 +15,21 @@ The application will now be running on `http://localhost:11224`.
 - **[React](https://react.dev/)**: Used for UI components.
 - **[Tailwind CSS](https://tailwindcss.com/)**: For styling the application.
 - **[Astro DB](https://docs.astro.build/en/guides/database/)**: Powers the comments feature, using a libSQL-compatible database.
+
+## WebMCP tools for AI agents
+
+The site exposes client-side [WebMCP](https://webmachinelearning.github.io/webmcp/) tools that in-browser AI agents can discover and call (Chromium 146+ with `chrome://flags/#enable-webmcp-testing`). Browsers without WebMCP ignore all of this.
+
+| Tool | Kind | Where | What it does |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| `search-articles` | Declarative form | Every page (search flyout) | Searches article titles and summaries |
+| `add-to-reading-list` | Declarative form | Every page (reading-list flyout) | Saves an article to the reading list |
+| `remove-from-reading-list` | Declarative form | Every page (reading-list flyout) | Removes a saved article |
+| `list_articles` | Imperative | Every page (`SiteAgentTools.tsx`) | Lists the newest articles, optionally by section |
+| `get_reading_list` | Imperative | Every page | Returns the saved articles |
+| `open_article` | Imperative | Every page | Opens an article by slug |
+| `get_current_article` | Imperative | Article pages (`ArticleAgentTools.tsx`) | Metadata, full body text, reading time |
+| `find_in_article` | Imperative | Article pages | Finds passages mentioning a phrase and scrolls to the first |
+| `get_related_articles` | Imperative | Article pages | Recommended next reads |
+
+The flyouts stay mounted (hidden while closed) so their forms are always discoverable, and they open as soon as an agent starts using one of their tools.
